sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator screen
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant K as Live camera
  participant A as Active subsystem
  Note over S,K: Any time during a run.<br/>The Supervisor checks that the live feed is alive.<br/>Plate, screw and photo checks all depend on it.
  S->>A: CMD_START (spot 12, current step)
  K--xS: feed lost (no frames, lens blocked, or image too dark)
  S->>A: CMD_ABORT (stop current step safely)
  A-->>S: STOPPED, safe state
  S->>Op: ALERT: robot stopped. Spot 12, Camera, CAMERA_FEED_LOST
  Note over S: Stack light turns flashing amber, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Robot waits at spot 12.<br/>No retry and no skip, because<br/>nothing can be verified without the camera.
  Op->>S: RESOLVED (lens cleaned, cable fixed or light replaced, feed is back)
  S->>A: CMD_START (spot 12, resume same step)
  A-->>S: DONE
